    "intro": {
      "zh": "Apple IIe 是苹果公司 1983 年 1 月发布的 Apple II 系列增强型 8 位个人计算机，是个人电脑史上最长寿、最成功产品线之一的中坚机型。「e」代表 enhanced（增强）。它延续 Apple II 的开放架构与 6502 平台，内置 80 列文本显示、支持小写字母并扩展内存，在教育与家用市场畅销十余年，一直生产到 1993 年，是整整一代学生与家庭的第一台电脑。",
      "en": "The Apple IIe is Apple Computer's enhanced 8-bit personal computer of the Apple II line, released in January 1983. The 'e' stands for enhanced. It continued the open architecture and 6502 platform of the Apple II, added built-in 80-column text and lowercase support and expanded memory, remaining a mainstay of education and home markets for over a decade."
    },
    "era": 1983,
    "manufacturer": "Apple Computer, Inc."
